%%{init: {'theme':'base'}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Usuário
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BFF as BFF Gateway
    participant Orch as Orchestrator
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant QW as Queue Worker
    participant OC as Offchain Consumer
    participant BC as Blockchain (Besu)
    participant EL as Event Listener

    User->>FE: Preenche formulário de registro
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/properties/register<br/>{matriculaId, proprietario, ...}
    BFF->>Orch: Proxy: POST /properties/register<br/>+ JWT validation

    Orch->>Orch: Validar dados de entrada
    Orch->>DB: Verificar se matricula existe
    DB-->>Orch: Not found

    Orch->>DB: INSERT property<br/>status = PENDENTE
    DB-->>Orch: Property ID created

    Orch->>MQ: Publish REGISTER_PROPERTY job<br/>{propertyId, matriculaId, ...}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE status = PROCESSANDO_REGISTRO
    Orch-->>BFF: 201 Created {propertyId}
    BFF-->>FE: Property registration initiated
    FE-->>User: Aguardando aprovações...

    MQ-->>QW: Consume REGISTER_PROPERTY job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/properties/register<br/>{matriculaId, beneficiary, ...}

    OC->>OC: Build transaction
    OC->>BC: requestPropertyRegistration(matricula, beneficiary)
    BC-->>OC: TX Hash: 0xabc...
    OC-->>QW: {requestHash, txHash}

    BC->>BC: Mine transaction
    BC->>BC: Emit RegistrationRequested event<br/>{requestHash, matricula, beneficiary}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/blockchain/properties/<br/>registration-requested<br/>{requestHash, matriculaId, txHash}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE property<br/>request_hash, blockchain_tx_hash
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over User,BC: === Fase de Aprovações ===

    User->>FE: Instituição Financeira aprova
    FE->>BFF: POST /api/properties/{id}/approve
    BFF->>Orch: POST /properties/{id}/approve
    Orch->>MQ: Publish APPROVE_REGISTRATION job
    MQ-->>QW: Consume job
    QW->>OC: POST /api/properties/approve<br/>{requestHash, institution: FINANCIAL}
    OC->>BC: approveRegistrationAsFinancial(requestHash)
    BC->>BC: Emit RegistrationApproved<br/>{requestHash, "FINANCIAL", approver}
    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-approved
    Orch->>DB: Record approval 1/3

    Note over BC: Repete para Cartório (2/3)<br/>e Prefeitura (3/3)

    BC->>BC: 3ª aprovação recebida<br/>Auto-execução: mint(beneficiary, matricula)
    BC->>BC: Emit RegistrationExecuted<br/>{requestHash, matricula, beneficiary}

    BC-->>EL: Event detected
    EL->>Orch: POST /webhooks/.../registration-executed<br/>{requestHash, matriculaId, beneficiary}
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE property<br/>status = OK
    Orch->>DB: UPDATE ownership
    Orch-->>EL: 200 OK

    Note over FE: Frontend polling ou WebSocket
    FE->>BFF: GET /api/properties/{id}
    BFF->>Orch: GET /properties/{id}
    Orch->>DB: SELECT property
    DB-->>Orch: {status: OK, ...}
    Orch-->>BFF: Property data
    BFF-->>FE: Property registered ✅
    FE-->>User: Propriedade registrada com sucesso!
